      "value": "This change will be reverted in an upcoming patch either to Open Beta, or to Live after release. \n\n**However, this change will be reintroduced in a future release.** Favorites within disabled VRC+ favorite lists (after a subscription has lapsed) will no longer be able to be moved out of those disabled lists unless you reactivate a subscription.",
